--------------------------------------------------------------------------
No game content is distributed
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No original game executable, asset, texture, mesh or audio data is distributed
with or by this repository. Capture, replay and diagnostic artifacts can embed
extracted game content and are excluded from version control for that reason
(see .gitignore). The project supports only offline/single-player titles that
the user is authorized to modify, and performs no anti-cheat or integrity
circumvention.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. tools/d3d9_interfaces.json

   This file is a machine-readable compilation of Direct3D 9 COM interface and
   method signatures, generated against Windows SDK 10.0.26100.0. It is derived
   from publicly documented API surface rather than copied SDK source. It is
   included so that tools/generate_observers.py can regenerate the forwarding
   layer without requiring a Windows SDK at build time.

   Windows and Direct3D are trademarks of Microsoft Corporation. No Microsoft
   source code or header file is redistributed here.

2. AMD FidelityFX SDK

   The FidelityFX Ray Regeneration and Radiance Cache research paths are
   OPTIONAL, opt-in build configurations gated on the RRT_FSR_SDK and
   RRT_FSR_RC_SDK CMake cache variables. No FidelityFX SDK source, header,
   library or signed binary is redistributed in this repository. Users who
   enable those paths supply their own copy of the SDK, and its licence applies
   to it. The default build and every default runtime path require no FidelityFX
   component.

3. Shader compilation

   DXIL is produced at build time by dxc.exe from the Windows SDK. No compiled
   DXIL is redistributed in this repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hardware evidence
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The measurements recorded in docs/ were taken on a single AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT
with driver 32.0.31041.1004. They do not establish performance or compatibility
on other GPUs. See docs/COMPATIBILITY_LEDGER.md for the current qualification
boundary.
